{"4277630": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "KharkivVision 2035", "steam_appid": 4277630, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KharkivVision-2035</strong> is a narrative-driven atmospheric game about <strong>survival, time, and difficult choices</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Mark</strong>, a young man who moves to <strong>Kharkiv</strong> in 2019 hoping to start a new life. Shortly after, he is diagnosed with a <strong>life-threatening illness</strong>.<br>He has <strong>only two months</strong> left to change his fate.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story unfolds between <strong>2019 - 2035</strong>, following Mark’s journey through the realities of a large city:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >finding work</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >building relationships</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >facing betrayal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >making choices when time is running out</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision matters. Not all of them can be undone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a story about:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >how fragile ordinary life can be</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >fear and hope existing side by side</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >what truly matters when the future is uncertain</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>hand-crafted, atmospheric open city</strong> inspired by Kharkiv, changing over time 2019-2035</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4277630/extras/0184269b18b1f827a47bef9eae348aad.poster.avif?t=1781550490\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4277630/extras/0184269b18b1f827a47bef9eae348aad.webm?t=1781550490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4277630/extras/0184269b18b1f827a47bef9eae348aad.mp4?t=1781550490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore freely between story missions:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >return to your apartment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ride the metro</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >drive through the city</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A grounded, emotional story told through dialogue and inner monologues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic everyday situations instead of exaggerated drama</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus on mood, immersion, and storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Created by a solo developer</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narrative exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-driven cutscenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dialogue choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimal UI and intuitive controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No unnecessary mechanics — the focus is on the story</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This Game Is For You If</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You enjoy narrative-focused games like <strong>Life is Strange</strong>, <strong>Firewatch</strong>, or <strong>What Remains of Edith Finch</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You prefer atmosphere and meaning over action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re looking for a short, emotionally impactful experience</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Development</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KharkivVision-2035</strong> is developed by an independent solo developer from Kharkiv using <strong>Unreal Engine</strong>.<br>All locations, mechanics, story, UI, and cutscenes are handcrafted.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>free demo</strong> is available, allowing you to experience the opening chapter and the atmosphere of the game.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KharkivVision-2035</strong> is a narrative-driven atmospheric game about <strong>survival, time, and difficult choices</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Mark</strong>, a young man who moves to <strong>Kharkiv</strong> in 2019 hoping to start a new life. Shortly after, he is diagnosed with a <strong>life-threatening illness</strong>.<br>He has <strong>only two months</strong> left to change his fate.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story unfolds between <strong>2019 - 2035</strong>, following Mark’s journey through the realities of a large city:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >finding work</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >building relationships</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >facing betrayal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >making choices when time is running out</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision matters. Not all of them can be undone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a story about:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >how fragile ordinary life can be</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >fear and hope existing side by side</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >what truly matters when the future is uncertain</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>hand-crafted, atmospheric open city</strong> inspired by Kharkiv, changing over time 2019-2035</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop pla