 looking for a short, emotionally impactful experience</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Development</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KharkivVision-2035</strong> is developed by an independent solo developer from Kharkiv using <strong>Unreal Engine</strong>.<br>All locations, mechanics, story, UI, and cutscenes are handcrafted.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>free demo</strong> is available, allowing you to experience the opening chapter and the atmosphere of the game.</p>", "short_description": "The line between the real Kharkiv of 2019 and the futuristic visions of 2035 is gradually blurring. Which of this is real life, and which is merely a sanctuary for a mind seeking salvation?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Ukrainian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4277630/bc0ba02ff4790e98fbf6cf5b7bc5dd9e44253116/header.jpg?t=1781550490", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4277630/dab29595e87870f5b370734f20cde325c0339e60/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781550490", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4277630/dab29595e87870f5b370734f20cde325c0339e60/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781550490", "website": "https://kharkivcity2030.pp.ua/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel® Core™ i7-4770 | AMD Ryzen™ 3300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  NVIDIA GeForce® GTX 1630 (4GB VRAM) | AMD Radeon™ RX 6400 (4GB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 26 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br>